{"projectInfo":{"name":"DHCPv6 Snooping典型配置举例","path":"hcl_usfgnb","visibility":2,"categoryId":106,"introduction":"Switch2通过以太网端口GE1/0/1连接到合法DHCPv6服务器，通过以太网端口GE1/0/3连接到非法服务器，通过GE1/0/2连接到DHCPv6客户端。要求：与合法DHCPv6服务器相连的端口可以转发DHCPv6服务器的响应报文，而其他端口不转发DHCPv6服务器的响应报文。记录DHCPv6客户端IPv6地址及MAC地址的绑定关系。","label":["DHCPv6 Snooping"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"SW1","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SW1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SW3","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SW3.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SW2","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SW2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"DHCPv6 Client","resourceCategory":"终端设备","resourceModel":"PC","resourceVersion":"","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\DHCPv6 Client.cfg"}]}